section
open Formalism.WeaklyAdmissibleFiltrations Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.BasicNotions.Loc Formalism.MainNotions.N Formalism.MainNotions.LocalSituation GlobalTheory.Cyc GlobalTheory.ExpImage

